{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18818","headline":"萋兮吟 · 刘禹锡","name":"萋兮吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天涯浮云生，争蔽日月光。\n穷巷秋风起，先摧兰蕙芳。\n万货列旗亭，恣心注明璫。\n名高毁所集，言巧智难防。\n勿谓行大道，斯须成太行。\n莫吟萋兮什，徒使君子伤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18818.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18818","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}